lemma aboveV (hi:t ≤ m)(ht:m≤ nY)(hx:0<Xc)(hG:Wt nY Lx ≤ Xc)(hY:∀ b:Cover,VK nY hCw b Lx Xc Xc Pz (FPC P₀ A B Gν nY b)):∃ v':ℕ→Massive.UV.Label Gn,∃ S:ℕ→ℝ,Ψ v' S Gν hCw m:=by
    induction ht using Nat.decreasingInduction with
    | self=> exact ⟨fun _=>Lx,fun _=>Xc,⟨rfl,rfl,fun i _ _=>hx,fun i h0 h =>le_antisymm h h0 ▸ hG,fun i h g=>le_antisymm g h ▸ hY,fun i hi h =>(by omega),fun i hi h =>(by omega)⟩⟩ -- eq anchor
    | of_succ i h ih=>
       obtain ⟨v,S,H⟩:= ih (Nat.le_step hi); have hF:= H.alive (i+1) le_rfl h; have hz:= hP.gapQ i hi; let W' := Wp i (v (i+1)); let φ:= Bounce.wages (a∘fun i=> A.node i) (fun i=>Kit.slope (A.spacing i)) Gn i W' (S (i+1))
       obtain ⟨y,hV,hY⟩:= starWay P₀ A X B T Z V U W F hp hX hc E M₀ he Y hh C Ht O L1 hC Θ Uv i0 Gn ξ Ξ (hP.viewQ i hi) (hP.vac i hi) (hPt i hi (h.trans_le hCw).le) (hPk i hi (h.trans_le hCw).le) (v (i+1)) Pz a hP.honors (γ i) hz Jp Gν hAq hM₀ hCw hTk h hTol (S (i+1)) (H.charge _ le_rfl h) hF (H.poses _ le_rfl h)
       let u₀:= Kit.slope (A.spacing i); have ht0:= hz.earns (A.node (i+1)) rfl; have hc : W' = toted u₀ (v (i+1)) (up (Pt (i+1))) (fan (A.spacing i) θ (run (A.spacing i) (clockQ P₀ A x i))):=by unfold W' eff; rw [(LifeT.footing P₀ A).2] -- unfolds?
       have hpz : 0 ≤ W':= by rw [hc]; exact (mul_nonneg (pow_nonneg ht0.moves.le _) (wealth_ge ..)).trans (Stair.lowerS _ ht0.moves.le ht0.bounded)
       let ψ:= Wt i y; let pn:= φ+ψ; have hφ:0<φ:= mul_pos (zero_lt_one.trans_le ht0.starts) (add_pos_of_nonneg_of_pos hpz (mul_pos (pow_pos ht0.moves _) hF))
       let v':=Function.update v i y; let Ue:=Function.update S i pn; refine ⟨v',Ue,⟨ (update_of_ne h.ne' ..).trans H.surname, (update_of_ne h.ne' ..).trans H.stature, fun j hi hg=>?_,fun j hi hg=> ?_,fun j hi hg=> ?_,fun j hi hg=>?_,fun j hi hg=>?_⟩⟩
       · rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hi with ht|ht; subst j; unfold Ue; rw [update_self]; exact add_pos_of_pos_of_nonneg hφ (wealth_ge ..); unfold Ue; rw [update_of_ne ht.ne']; exact H.alive _ ht hg
       · rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hi with ht|ht
         · subst j; unfold v' Ue; rw [update_self,update_self]; exact le_add_of_nonneg_left hφ.le
         unfold v' Ue; rw [update_of_ne ht.ne',update_of_ne ht.ne']; exact H.charge _ ht hg
       · rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hi with ht|ht
         · subst j; unfold v' Ue; rw [update_self,update_self]; intro b; obtain ⟨H,h_,hY⟩:=(hY b).stocked; have hz : φ≤ pn:= le_add_of_nonneg_right (show 0≤ ψ from wealth_ge ..); unfold φ at hz; rw [hc] at hz; exact ⟨H,h_,Ontario.pays_u hY hz hz⟩
         unfold v' Ue; rw [update_of_ne ht.ne',update_of_ne ht.ne']; exact H.poses _ ht hg
       · rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hi with ht|ht
         · subst j; unfold v' Ue; rw [update_self,update_self,update_of_ne (show i+1≠i by omega),update_of_ne (show i+1≠i by omega)]
         unfold v' Ue; simp_rw [update_of_ne ht.ne',update_of_ne (show j+1≠i by omega)]; exact H.proceeds _ ht hg
       rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hi with ht|ht
       · subst j; unfold v' Ue; rw [update_self,update_of_ne (show i+1≠i by omega),update_of_ne (show i+1≠i by omega)]; exact hV
       unfold v' Ue; simp_rw [update_of_ne ht.ne',update_of_ne (show j+1≠i by omega)]; exact H.studies _ ht hg
